  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0: every flyout now sits on the material the user picks in WidBar (acrylic, dense acrylic or Mica, acrylic by default), applied from the first open and changed live. Widgets no longer choose it: FlyoutBackdrop and WidgetFlyoutBackdrop are obsolete and ignored, and existing overrides still compile. A stacked widget hidden while the pointer was over it no longer keeps its hover highlight. The flyout drops its open animation once it has finished, so its content is no longer drawn through an extra layer while it is open.",
